---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { EMAIL } from '../site';
---
<Base title="Contact">
  <h1>Say <strong>hello</strong></h1>
  <div class="prose" style="margin-top:2rem">
    <p>Email is best: <a href={`mailto:${EMAIL}`}>{EMAIL}</a>. I reply within a couple of working days.</p>
    <p>If it's about a project, it helps to include:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>What you're trying to achieve, and why now</li>
      <li>What exists today (systems, team, data)</li>
      <li>Rough timeline and budget</li>
    </ul>
    <p><a class="btn" href={`mailto:${EMAIL}?subject=Project%20enquiry`}>Email me</a></p>
  </div>
</Base>
